# Session-scoped progress / state files written by agents and skills
# (autofix-pr persistence, test-progress checkpoint, recovery notes).
# VCR recordings. shouldUseVCR() is true whenever NODE_ENV === 'test', i.e. on
# every `bun test` run, and the writer defaults its root to getCwd() — so any
# test that reaches a VCR-wrapped call drops fixtures/*.json in the repo root.
# Nothing here is tracked (`git ls-files fixtures/` is empty), and leaving them
# untracked-but-visible made `biome check` fail on unformatted JSON after a
# plain test run. Set CLAUDE_CODE_TEST_FIXTURES_ROOT to relocate them.
/fixtures/

# Transient, never meant to enter the repo.
.claude-impl-state.md
.claude-progress.md
.claude-recovery.md
.test-progress.md
.squash-tmp/
.git.*-backup
scripts/system-prompt-dump.txt
